<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Student Project Showcase</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#fff3f7;color:#482b3b}
header{text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b94e83,#7558c9);color:white;padding:45px 20px}
header h1{font-size:35px}
main{max-width:950px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 18px}
.projects{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:white;padding:23px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 5px 15px #ead9e2}
.icon{font-size:38px}
h2{color:#a63d76}
.category{display:inline-block;background:#ffe0ed;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<p>MY LEARNING PORTFOLIO</p>
<h1>✨ Student Project Showcase</h1>
<p>Small projects, new skills and continuous learning.</p>
</header>
<main>
<h2>Featured Projects</h2>
<div class="projects">
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🌸</div><h2>Creative Webpage</h2><p>A colorful webpage built with HTML and CSS.</p><span class="category">Web Design</span></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">📚</div><h2>Study Resource Hub</h2><p>A simple collection of learning resources and notes.</p><span class="category">Education</span></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">💻</div><h2>Computer Science Guide</h2><p>A beginner-friendly guide to important computing concepts.</p><span class="category">Computer Science</span></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🗓️</div><h2>Study Schedule</h2><p>A static timetable layout to organize study sessions.</p><span class="category">Student Life</span></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🗄️</div><h2>Database Notes</h2><p>Revision notes about tables, keys and relationships.</p><span class="category">DBMS</span></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🚀</div><h2>Next Project</h2><p>Add your next completed project here and describe what you learned.</p><span class="category">In Progress</span></article>
</div>
</main>
<footer>Made with 💗 and a passion for learning.</footer>
</body>
</html>
